    {
      "id": "c6d5d9a6-0999-49a9-ac74-955617dec89a",
      "text": "On November 13, 2026, C20 authorized a native SwiftUI foundation and device-readiness check. The source exists under `native/` and passes a simulator build; capture and the hidden sidebar follow the supplied screenshots, but other sections are placeholders. Demo memories are process-local and disappear on exit, and recording/attachment controls only show scope notices. Microphone access, imports, AI, networking, production store, release, deployment, physical iPhone launch, and phone benchmarks are not implemented or verified. | When: November 13, 2026 | Involving: C20; memoryos project | This is a dated implementation checkpoint; the document explicitly states it is a snapshot, not proof of implementation beyond the listed checks.",
