    {
      "id": "eef84d2c-89c2-413e-9e4e-a1c24bcbe686",
      "text": "C35 authorizes Step 1 of reliable local storage and text capture. The selected design uses the OS SQLite library behind an app-owned protocol, schema/archive version 1, app-owned immutable originals with correction history, stable links, reversible Trash, and explicit readable JSON export with transactional merge restore; this resolves A02 for the implementation. | When: November 14, 2026 | Involving: Project memoryos | This is an explicit storage decision for Step 1, while AI/search provider selection, permanent deletion, automatic cloud backup, custom encryption/key recovery, and sync remain unsettled.",
